translate zh strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:2
    old "A womanly Dros"
    new "女性化的德罗斯"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:2
    old "Dros has asked for your help to become more 'womanly'."
    new "德罗斯请求你帮助他变得更'女性化'。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:11
    old "I will help you become more 'womanly'."
    new "我会帮你变得更'女性化'。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:22
    old "A Graceful Rebirth"
    new "优雅的重生"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:23
    old "I have agreed to help Dros step over into his... Feminine side."
    new "我已同意帮助德罗斯踏入他的...女性化一面。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Speak to Sister Divine"
    new "与神圣修女交谈"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Dros' intuition led him to the Palam tower, however, the mages turned down his plea for help. I should investigate."
    new "德罗斯的直觉将他带往帕拉姆之塔，但法师们拒绝了他的求助。我应该去调查一下。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Get the herbs for the ritual"
    new "获取仪式所需的草药"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Sister Divine would need a collection of special herbs to conduct the ritual. I should try a merchant."
    new "神圣修女需要一些特殊草药来进行仪式。我应该找个商人试试。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Deal with Jurgen"
    new "处理尤尔根"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "I could help Lucius Mal deal with a strung-up guard in exchange for the herbs. The guard goes by the name Jurgen, I can find him in the Iron Unicorn."
    new "我可以帮卢修斯·马尔处理一个难缠的守卫来换取草药。那守卫名叫尤尔根，我能在铁独角兽找到他。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Bring five slimelark remains to Sister Divine"
    new "带五份史莱姆雀残骸给神圣修女"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "I should look for slimelarks near a lake."
    new "我应该在湖边寻找粘液雀。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Warn Dros about the ritual"
    new "警告德罗斯关于仪式的风险"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "The transformation ritual is a dangerous one. I should make sure Dros wants it."
    new "转化仪式很危险。我应该确认德罗斯确实想要进行。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Get Dros"
    new "带上德罗斯"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:25
    old "Sister Divine has everything she needs. Now, gotta bring Dros over."
    new "神圣修女已准备好一切。现在，需要带德罗斯过去。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:59
    old "Dros has a problem you might be able to solve..."
    new "德罗斯有个问题，也许你能解决..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:61
    old "About the ritual..."
    new "关于那个仪式..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:63
    old "There is a magic ritual that might make you more 'womanly', but..."
    new "有一个魔法仪式或许能让你更'女性化'，但是..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:66
    old "I need some special herbs."
    new "我需要一些特殊草药。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:71
    old "About these herbs..."
    new "关于这些草药..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:79
    old "Do you have Amira's tears?"
    new "你有阿米拉的眼泪吗？"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:81
    old "Do you have some Raza?"
    new "你有一些拉扎吗？"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:83
    old "Sister Divine is ready for you now."
    new "神圣修女现在为你准备好了。"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:95
    old "Talk to Jurgen"
    new "与尤尔根交谈"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AGracefulRebirth/qst_AGracefulRebirth.rpy:97
    old "Talk to the Guard"
    new "与守卫交谈"# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-03-18 02:10

